{"code":"de-DE","name":"German","native":"Deutsch","badge":"DE","tts":"de-DE","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Ich verstehe nicht.","say":"ish fer-SHTAY-uh nisht","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Ich weiß nicht.","say":"ish VICE nisht","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Einen Moment, bitte.","say":"EYE-nen moh-MENT, BIT-uh","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Können Sie das wiederholen?","say":"KUH-nen zee dahs vee-der-HOH-len","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Langsamer, bitte.","say":"LAHNG-zah-mer, BIT-uh","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Wie sagt man „…“?","say":"vee ZAHKT mahn","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Klar.","say":"klahr","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Genau.","say":"geh-NOW","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree","hook":"The single most German word: say it while nodding."},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Ich glaube schon.","say":"ish GLOW-buh shohn","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Wirklich?","say":"VEERK-lish","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Kein Problem.","say":"kine proh-BLAYM","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Super!","say":"ZOO-per","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Wo ist {x}?","say":"voh ist {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Ich hätte gern {x:acc}.","say":"ish HET-uh gairn {x:acc}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Haben Sie {x:acc}?","say":"HAH-ben zee {x:acc}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, bitte.","say":"{x:acc}, BIT-uh","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Ich muss {x}.","say":"ish MOOS {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Darf ich {x}?","say":"darf ish {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Ich schaue nach.","say":"ish SHOW-uh nahkh","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Ich habe ein Meeting.","say":"ish HAH-buh ine MEE-ting","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Ist das scharf?","say":"ist dahs SHARF","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Ohne Zwiebeln, bitte.","say":"OH-nuh TSVEE-beln, BIT-uh","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Was empfehlen Sie?","say":"vahs emp-FAY-len zee","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Ich esse kein Fleisch.","say":"ish ES-uh kine FLYSH","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Was kostet das?","say":"vahs KOS-tet dahs","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Ich schaue nur.","say":"ish SHOW-uh noor","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Ich nehme es.","say":"ish NAY-muh es","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Kann ich mit Karte zahlen?","say":"kahn ish mit KAR-tuh TSAH-len","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Ist es weit?","say":"ist es VITE","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Zum Flughafen, bitte.","say":"tsoom FLOOK-hah-fen, BIT-uh","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"links · rechts · geradeaus","say":"links · reshts · geh-RAH-deh-ows","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Hilfe!","say":"HIL-fuh","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Es gibt kein Toilettenpapier.","say":"es gipt kine toy-LET-en-pah-peer","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Mir ist schlecht.","say":"meer ist SHLESHT","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Rufen Sie bitte einen Krankenwagen.","say":"ROO-fen zee BIT-uh EYE-nen KRAHN-ken-vah-gen","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Freut mich.","say":"froyt mish","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Woher kommen Sie?","say":"voh-HAIR KOM-en zee","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Was machen Sie beruflich?","say":"vahs MAHKH-en zee beh-ROOF-lish","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Das ist lecker!","say":"dahs ist LEK-er","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Hallo.","say":"HAH-loh","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Guten Morgen.","say":"GOO-ten MOR-gen","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Wie geht’s?","say":"vee GAYTS","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ja. · Nein.","say":"yah · nine","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Bitte.","say":"BIT-uh","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Danke.","say":"DAHN-kuh","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Entschuldigung.","say":"ent-SHOOL-dee-goong","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Tschüss.","say":"chewss","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"eins · zwei · drei","say":"ines · tsvy · dry","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"vier · fünf · sechs","say":"feer · fewnf · zeks","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"sieben · acht · neun","say":"ZEE-ben · ahkht · noyn","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"zehn · zwanzig · hundert","say":"tsayn · TSVAHN-tsish · HOON-dert","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Der Apfel ist rot.","say":"dair AHP-fel ist roht","en":"The apple is red.","note":"der = masculine “the” · the adjective after ist doesn’t change"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Ich esse den Apfel.","say":"ish ES-uh dayn AHP-fel","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"der → den: the object takes a different “the” (case)"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Ich habe den Apfel gegessen.","say":"ish HAH-buh dayn AHP-fel geh-GES-en","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: haben + participle at the end"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Ich will den Apfel essen.","say":"ish vil dayn AHP-fel ES-en","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper verb second, infinitive goes to the end"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Isst du Äpfel?","say":"ist doo EP-fel","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"verb first makes a question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"die Toilette","say":"dee toy-LET-uh","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"die Apotheke","say":"dee ah-poh-TAY-kuh","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"das Krankenhaus","say":"dahs KRAHN-ken-hows","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"der Bahnhof","say":"dair BAHN-hohf","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway","acc":"den Bahnhof","accSay":"dayn BAHN-hohf"},{"id":"airport","t":"der Flughafen","say":"dair FLOOK-hah-fen","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane","acc":"den Flughafen","accSay":"dayn FLOOK-hah-fen"},{"id":"hotel","t":"das Hotel","say":"dahs hoh-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"Wasser","say":"VAH-ser","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"ein Kaffee","say":"ine KAH-fay","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink","acc":"einen Kaffee","accSay":"EYE-nen KAH-fay"},{"id":"bill","t":"die Rechnung","say":"dee RESH-noong","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"die Speisekarte","say":"dee SHPY-zuh-kar-tuh","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"ein Bier","say":"ine BEER","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"das hier","say":"dahs heer","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"eine Tüte","say":"EYE-nuh TEW-tuh","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"das Meeting","say":"dahs MEE-ting","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"die Datei","say":"dee dah-TY","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"der Bildschirm","say":"dair BILT-sheerm","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen","acc":"den Bildschirm","accSay":"dayn BILT-sheerm"},{"id":"message","t":"die Nachricht","say":"dee NAHKH-risht","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"morgen","say":"MOR-gen","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"los","say":"lohs","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"reinkommen","say":"RINE-kom-en","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"zahlen","say":"TSAH-len","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Allergie · bitte lesen","ask":"Ist eine dieser Zutaten in diesem Gericht?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Vielen Dank!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Ich habe eine schwere Erdnussallergie. Ich darf keine Erdnüsse und kein Erdnussöl essen.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Ich habe eine schwere Allergie gegen Meeresfrüchte (Garnelen, Krebse, Muscheln).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Ich darf kein Gluten essen (Weizen, Gerste, Roggen).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Ich esse kein Fleisch, kein Huhn und keinen Fisch.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Ich esse kein Schweinefleisch.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOILETTEN · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"DAMEN · HERREN","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"AUSGANG · EINGANG","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"DRÜCKEN · ZIEHEN","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"NOTAUSGANG","en":"Emergency exit"}]}